{"seq":3,"slug":"transmission-integration","title":"传动系统与集成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems/transmission-integration","wordCount":1719,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"传动系统与集成\">传动系统与集成</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>传动系统将电机的高速旋转运动通过减速增扭传递至车轮，同时电驱总成的集成度越来越高，从分体式走向&quot;三合一&quot;甚至&quot;多合一&quot;。传动系统的设计质量直接影响整车动力性、经济性和NVH舒适性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单级减速器设计\">单级减速器设计</h3><p>纯电动汽车最常用的传动方案为单级定速比减速器，结构简单、效率高、成本低。典型结构为一对斜齿轮+差速器：</p>\n<p>传动比选择需平衡最高车速与起步加速性能：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{max} = \\frac{\\pi \\times n_{max} \\times r_{wheel}}{30 \\times i_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{wheel} = T_{motor} \\times i_0 \\times \\eta_{gear}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为总速比（典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7-12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电机最高转速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{wheel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为车轮滚动半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{gear}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为齿轮传动效率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>97</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;97\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">97%</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p>设计约束：高速工况（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> km/h）下电机需在高效区运行；低速大扭矩（如爬坡）时电机转矩足够。单速比的局限在于无法同时兼顾——高速比有利于加速但限制最高车速，低速比反之。</p>\n<p><strong>齿轮设计要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>斜齿轮螺旋角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15°-25°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span></span></span></span></span>，啮合重合度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span>，降低传递噪声</li>\n<li>齿面硬度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>58</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;58</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">58</span></span></span></span></span> HRC（渗碳淬火），满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 万公里耐久要求</li>\n<li>轴承选型：圆锥滚子轴承承受轴向力，深沟球轴承辅助支撑</li>\n<li>润滑方式：飞溅润滑（低速）+ 强制喷油润滑（高速）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"多挡dht混动专用变速箱\">多挡DHT混动专用变速箱</h3><p>插电式混动（PHEV）和增程式车型需要更复杂的传动方案，DHT（Dedicated Hybrid Transmission）是当前主流架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;发动机&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;离合器/行星齿轮&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;驱动电机 P1&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;多挡齿轮组&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;差速器&quot;]&#10;    F[&quot;驱动电机 P2&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;车轮&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"发动机\"] --&gt; B[\"离合器/行星齿轮\"]\n    C[\"驱动电机 P1\"] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[\"多挡齿轮组\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"差速器\"]\n    F[\"驱动电机 P2\"] --&gt; D\n    E --&gt; G[\"车轮\"]</pre><p><strong>典型DHT方案对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>挡位数</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>串并联DHT</td>\n<td>2-3挡</td>\n<td>比亚迪DM-i</td>\n<td>低速串联、高速并联直驱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功率分流</td>\n<td>无级变速</td>\n<td>丰田THS</td>\n<td>行星齿轮耦合，效率高但电机功率受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多挡DHT</td>\n<td>2-4挡</td>\n<td>吉利雷神</td>\n<td>兼顾纯电高速和混动低油耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多挡变速的核心价值在于拓宽电机高效工作区域覆盖率。以2挡方案为例：1挡速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_1 = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>（起步加速和低速纯电），2挡速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_2 = 6.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.5</span></span></span></span></span>（高速巡航）。换挡策略基于驾驶工况、SOC和效率MAP联合优化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电驱总成-三合一-集成\">电驱总成&quot;三合一&quot;集成</h3><p>&quot;三合一&quot;电驱总成（EDU，Electric Drive Unit）将电机、电机控制器和减速器集成为一个紧凑单元，是纯电动汽车的主流方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三合一</td>\n<td>电机+控制器+减速器</td>\n<td>减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span> 体积，降低线束长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>五合一</td>\n<td>+DC-DC+OBC</td>\n<td>进一步集成充电组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>七合一</td>\n<td>+PDU+BMS</td>\n<td>全域电动力集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>八合一</td>\n<td>+热管理集成模块</td>\n<td>极致集成（华为方案）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三合一集成的工程挑战：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>热域隔离</strong>：电机工作温度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，控制器结温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>125</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;125°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，需隔热结构和独立冷却回路</li>\n<li><strong>EMC互耦</strong>：高频开关噪声耦合到电机侧传感器（旋变/编码器），需屏蔽和滤波设计</li>\n<li><strong>共用润滑油</strong>：减速器齿轮油兼做电机冷却油时，需兼容两者的温度和粘度需求</li>\n<li><strong>维修性</strong>：高集成度导致单一组件故障可能需要整体更换</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"nvh优化\">NVH优化</h3><p>电驱动系统的NVH（Noise, Vibration, Harshness）问题不同于传统发动机，主要噪声源为电磁噪声和齿轮啮合噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>电磁噪声</strong>来源于电机气隙磁场的径向分力作用在定子铁芯上引起的振动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{noise} = 2 \\times p \\times f_{elec} \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为谐波阶次。12极电机在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span> rpm时，基频电磁噪声频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 6 \\times 1000 = 12000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12000</span></span></span></span></span> Hz，落入人耳敏感区域。</p>\n<p>电磁噪声抑制措施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定子槽口优化（半闭口槽、磁槽楔）</li>\n<li>极槽配合选择（如48槽8极避免低阶力波）</li>\n<li>转子磁极偏斜（斜极 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个槽距）</li>\n<li>注塑封装减振</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>齿轮啮合噪声</strong>由传递误差（TE）引起，频率为啮合频率及其谐波：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{mesh} = z \\times n / 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/60</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为齿数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为转速（rpm）。减小传递误差的手段包括：微观修形（齿顶/齿根修缘、螺旋角修形）、提高齿面加工精度（6级以上）、优化齿轮副重合度。</p>\n<p><strong>整车级NVH</strong>还涉及电驱动力总成的悬置系统设计——通过橡胶悬置或液压悬置隔振，截断结构传递路径。悬置固有频率设计在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8-12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> Hz，远低于电磁激励频率，实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> dB的隔振量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>超高速减速器</strong>：配合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25000</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25000+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25000</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> rpm电机，采用高精度磨齿和喷油润滑，传动比可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14-16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>两挡纯电变速器</strong>：通过无缝换挡（预同步+电机调速配合）实现动力不中断，拓展高效区</li>\n<li><strong>同轴电驱</strong>：电机和减速器同轴布置，消除偏置力矩，适合后驱和四驱方案</li>\n<li><strong>直驱轮毂电机</strong>：取消所有传动环节，转矩直接作用于车轮。但簧下质量大、散热难是主要挑战</li>\n<li><strong>AI噪声主动控制</strong>：车内麦克风阵列采集电驱噪声，DSP反相叠加抵消，降噪 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> dB</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某纯电动车使用最高转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16000</span></span></span></span></span> rpm的电机，单级减速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_0 = 9.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.5</span></span></span></span></span>，车轮滚动半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 0.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.33</span></span></span></span></span> m。计算理论最高车速（km/h）。如果要达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> km/h，减速比应调至多少？</li>\n<li>为什么多数纯电动车采用单级减速而非多挡变速？从电机特性曲线（恒转矩区+恒功率区）角度解释。</li>\n<li>三合一电驱总成中，电机控制器的散热如何与电机散热协调？画出冷却回路示意图。</li>\n<li>某客户反馈&quot;高速行驶时车内有持续高频啸叫&quot;。从电磁噪声和齿轮噪声两个方向分析可能原因，设计诊断方案。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>传动系统的核心任务是将电机的高速低扭输出转化为车轮需要的低速高扭驱动力。单级减速器以极简结构满足大多数纯电车型需求，多挡DHT为混动和高性能车型提供更宽的高效覆盖。电驱总成的集成化趋势从三合一向七合一、八合一演进，在提升功率密度的同时对热管理和EMC提出更高要求。NVH优化需要从电磁设计、齿轮加工和悬置隔振三个层面协同处理。掌握传动集成的系统工程方法，是电驱动维修技师面对复杂故障时定位问题的关键能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"传动系统与集成","id":"传动系统与集成"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"单级减速器设计","id":"单级减速器设计"},{"level":3,"text":"多挡DHT混动专用变速箱","id":"多挡dht混动专用变速箱"},{"level":3,"text":"电驱总成\"三合一\"集成","id":"电驱总成-三合一-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"NVH优化","id":"nvh优化"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电机控制器与逆变器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems/motor-controller-inverter"},"next":{"title":"车载网络与通信","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control/vehicle-can-network"}}